#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/Pages.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Ìṣètò SmokePing"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot export or import the SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "Àwọn àṣẹ ẹ̀rọ rẹ kò dé gbogbo ẹ̀rọ, nítorí náà o kò lè kó ìṣètò SmokePing jáde tàbí kí o kó o wọlé. Béèrè lọ́wọ́ alábòójútó tí ó ní ààyè sí gbogbo ẹ̀rọ."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Export the SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Kó Ìṣètò SmokePing Jáde"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The export holds the plugin settings, the SmokePing targets the plugin has read, and which device each is mapped to, by the device's host name and description. It holds no data source, graph, RRD file, or credential."
msgstr "Ìkójáde náà ní àwọn ìṣètò àfikún, àwọn àfojúsùn SmokePing tí àfikún ti kà, àti ẹ̀rọ tí ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan sopọ̀ mọ́, nípasẹ̀ orúkọ olùgbàlejò àti àpèjúwe ẹ̀rọ náà. Kò ní orísun dátà, àwòrán, fáìlì RRD, tàbí ẹ̀rí ìdánimọ̀ kankan."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Ṣe ìgbàsílẹ̀"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Import a SmokePing Configuration"
msgstr "Kó Ìṣètò SmokePing Wọlé"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Choosing a file only checks it. The next screen lists every change the file would make, and nothing is written until you confirm that list. An import adds and updates; it never deletes a target or moves a mapping, and it never creates an RRD file or touches the SmokePing data directory."
msgstr "Yíyan fáìlì kàn ń ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀ nìkan ni. Ojú-ìwé tí ó tẹ̀lé yóò ṣe àkójọ gbogbo àyípadà tí fáìlì náà yóò ṣe, kò sì sí ohun tí a ó kọ títí tí o fi jẹ́rìí sí àtòjọ náà. Ìkówọlé máa ń fi kún un ó sì máa ń ṣe àtúnṣe; kì í pa àfojúsùn rẹ́ tàbí yí ìsopọ̀ padà láé, kò sì dá fáìlì RRD sílẹ̀ tàbí fọwọ́ kan àpò dátà SmokePing láé."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Check File"
msgstr "Ṣàyẹ̀wò Fáìlì"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Import Check"
msgstr "Àyẹ̀wò Ìkówọlé"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Nothing was written."
msgstr "A kò kọ ohunkóhun."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_import.php
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Padà"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The file cannot be imported until these errors are fixed. Nothing was written."
msgstr "A kò lè kó fáìlì náà wọlé títí tí a ó fi tún àwọn àṣìṣe wọ̀nyí ṣe. A kò kọ ohunkóhun."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "The installation already matches the file. There is nothing to import."
msgstr "Ìfisílẹ̀ náà ti bá fáìlì náà mu tẹ́lẹ̀. Kò sí ohunkóhun láti kó wọlé."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "Plan %s. Applying makes exactly these changes in one transaction. If the file or the installation changed since this check, the import is refused and you check again."
msgstr "Ètò %s. Ìmúlò yóò ṣe àwọn àyípadà wọ̀nyí gan-an ní ìṣẹ̀dá kan ṣoṣo. Bí fáìlì náà tàbí ìfisílẹ̀ bá ti yí padà láti ìgbà àyẹ̀wò yìí, a ó kọ̀ láti kó o wọlé, o ó sì tún ṣàyẹ̀wò rẹ̀."

#: lib/ConfigPage.php
msgid "Apply Import"
msgstr "Mú Ìkówọlé Ṣẹ"

#: lib/ConfigPage.php lib/ImportPage.php lib/InventoryForms.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Fagilé"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Add SmokePing Targets"
msgstr "Fi Àwọn Àfojúsùn SmokePing Kún Un"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "no matching SmokePing target"
msgstr "kò sí àfojúsùn SmokePing tí ó bá a mu"

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
msgid "Click Continue to add the SmokePing targets whose host is the host name of each selected device. Each target gets a summary graph for alerting and, when SmokePing's data can be graphed, a smoke graph. Devices are never created here."
msgstr "Tẹ Tẹ̀síwájú láti fi àwọn àfojúsùn SmokePing tí olùgbàlejò wọn jẹ́ orúkọ olùgbàlejò ti ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan tí a yàn kún un. Àfojúsùn kọ̀ọ̀kan yóò gba àwòrán àkópọ̀ fún ìkìlọ̀ àti, nígbà tí a bá lè ya àwòrán dátà SmokePing, àwòrán smoke kan. A kì í dá àwọn ẹ̀rọ sílẹ̀ níbí láé."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets match."
msgstr "Àwọn àfojúsùn %d bá a mu."

#: lib/DeviceActions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d objects created or mapped, %d skipped."
msgstr "A dá tàbí sopọ̀ àwọn ohun %d, a fò %d lọ."

#: lib/DeviceSaveCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "This device has SmokePing targets, but the reader that fills their summary values runs on poller %d and the device is saved on poller %d. Summary values and alerts stop until the device is assigned to poller %d again."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ yìí ní àwọn àfojúsùn SmokePing, ṣùgbọ́n olùka tí ó ń kún àwọn ìwọ̀n àkópọ̀ wọn ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò %d, a sì fi ẹ̀rọ náà pamọ́ sórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò %d. Àwọn ìwọ̀n àkópọ̀ àti ìkìlọ̀ yóò dúró títí tí a ó fi yan ẹ̀rọ náà fún olùṣàyẹ̀wò %d lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i."

#: lib/GraphLinks.php
msgid "SmokePing Targets of this Device"
msgstr "Àwọn Àfojúsùn SmokePing ti Ẹ̀rọ Yìí"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs still draw the other colors; the main poller moves up to 200 per cycle."
msgstr "Àwọn àwòrán smoke %d ṣì ń ya àwọn àwọ̀ mìíràn; olùṣàyẹ̀wò àkọ́kọ́ máa ń gbé tó 200 ní ìpele kọ̀ọ̀kan."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d smoke graphs could not be moved; run upgrade-graphs to try them again, and see the Cacti log for the cause."
msgstr "Àwọn àwòrán smoke %d kò ṣe é gbé; ṣiṣẹ́ upgrade-graphs láti gbìyànjú wọn lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i, kí o sì wo àkọsílẹ̀ Cacti fún ìdí rẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting asks for SmokePing %s loss colors, but the reader found SmokePing %s. Set it to Automatic unless the graphs should differ from SmokePing's."
msgstr "Ìṣètò Àwọn Àwọ̀ Pípàdánù béèrè fún àwọn àwọ̀ pípàdánù SmokePing %s, ṣùgbọ́n olùka rí SmokePing %s. Ṣètò rẹ̀ sí Aládàáṣe àyàfi bí àwọn àwòrán bá yẹ kí ó yàtọ̀ sí ti SmokePing."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The Loss Colors setting selects SmokePing %s loss colors for smoke graphs."
msgstr "Ìṣètò Àwọn Àwọ̀ Pípàdánù yan àwọn àwọ̀ pípàdánù SmokePing %s fún àwọn àwòrán smoke."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader found no SmokePing version, so the Loss Colors setting selects the loss colors of SmokePing 2.8 and later. If SmokePing is 2.7, set Loss Colors to SmokePing 2.7."
msgstr "Olùka kò rí ẹ̀yà SmokePing kankan, nítorí náà ìṣètò Àwọn Àwọ̀ Pípàdánù yan àwọn àwọ̀ pípàdánù ti SmokePing 2.8 àti àwọn tó tẹ̀lé e. Bí SmokePing bá jẹ́ 2.7, ṣètò Àwọn Àwọ̀ Pípàdánù sí SmokePing 2.7."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader found SmokePing %s, so the Loss Colors setting selects its loss colors."
msgstr "Olùka rí SmokePing %s, nítorí náà ìṣètò Àwọn Àwọ̀ Pípàdánù yan àwọn àwọ̀ pípàdánù rẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Thold is not installed, so no target alerts in both SmokePing and Thold."
msgstr "A kò fi Thold sílẹ̀, nítorí náà kò sí àfojúsùn tí ó ń kìlọ̀ ní SmokePing àti Thold méjèèjì."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No target has both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold."
msgstr "Kò sí àfojúsùn tí ó ní ìkìlọ̀ SmokePing àti ààlà Thold tí a mú ṣiṣẹ́ méjèèjì."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d targets have both a SmokePing alert and an enabled Thold threshold, so one problem may notify twice. Compare their alert conditions before removing either: %s"
msgstr "Àwọn àfojúsùn %d ní ìkìlọ̀ SmokePing àti ààlà Thold tí a mú ṣiṣẹ́ méjèèjì, nítorí náà ìṣòro kan lè fi ìfitọ́nilétí ránṣẹ́ lẹ́ẹ̀mejì. Ṣe àfiwé àwọn ìpinnu ìkìlọ̀ wọn kí o tó yọ èyíkéyìí kúrò: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import and are not retried automatically: %s Use Retry Template Import after fixing the cause."
msgstr "Àwọn àdàkọ SmokePing kùnà láti kó wọlé, a kò sì tún gbìyànjú wọn lọ́nà aládàáṣe: %s Lo Tún Gbìyànjú Ìkówọlé Àdàkọ lẹ́yìn tí o bá tún ìdí rẹ̀ ṣe."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are not imported. Use Retry Template Import."
msgstr "A kò tíì kó àwọn àdàkọ SmokePing wọlé. Lo Tún Gbìyànjú Ìkówọlé Àdàkọ."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php smokeping_health.php
msgid "The SmokePing templates are imported."
msgstr "A ti kó àwọn àdàkọ SmokePing wọlé."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "Every device with summary data sources is polled by the reader's poller."
msgstr "Olùṣàyẹ̀wò ti olùka ni ó ń ṣàyẹ̀wò gbogbo ẹ̀rọ tí ó ní àwọn orísun dátà àkópọ̀."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d devices have summary data sources but are not polled by poller %d, which runs the reader, so their summary values and alerts have no data: %s"
msgstr "Àwọn ẹ̀rọ %d ní àwọn orísun dátà àkópọ̀ ṣùgbọ́n olùṣàyẹ̀wò %d, tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ olùka, kò ṣàyẹ̀wò wọn, nítorí náà àwọn ìwọ̀n àkópọ̀ àti ìkìlọ̀ wọn kò ní dátà: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration is read on poller %d, not on this server; the inventory row shows the result of its last read."
msgstr "A ń ka ìṣètò SmokePing lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò %d, kì í ṣe lórí sáfà yìí; ìlà àkójọpọ̀ fi èsì ìkà ìkẹyìn rẹ̀ hàn."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "A kò lè ka ìṣètò SmokePing %s: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets; %d entries are skipped: %s"
msgstr "Ìṣètò SmokePing %s ṣe àkójọ àwọn àfojúsùn %d; a fò àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ %d lọ: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration %s lists %d targets."
msgstr "Ìṣètò SmokePing %s ṣe àkójọ àwọn àfojúsùn %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The PHP binary path setting is empty or not an executable file, so the reader cannot start."
msgstr "Ìṣètò ọ̀nà fáìlì PHP ṣófo tàbí kì í ṣe fáìlì tí ó ṣe é ṣiṣẹ́, nítorí náà olùka kò lè bẹ̀rẹ̀."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader starts with %s."
msgstr "Olùka bẹ̀rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú %s."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "The reader has not completed a run on this poller."
msgstr "Olùka kò tíì parí ìṣiṣẹ́ kan lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò yìí."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last reader run finished %d seconds ago, more than three poller intervals."
msgstr "Ìṣiṣẹ́ olùka tí ó kẹ́yìn parí ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %d sẹ́yìn, ju àkókò olùṣàyẹ̀wò mẹ́ta lọ."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds and has exceeded its time budget %d times."
msgstr "Olùka ka ìtẹ̀léra %d nínú %d láàárín ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %.1f, ó sì ti kọjá àkókò tí a yàn fún un ní ìgbà %d."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The reader read %d of %d series in %.1f seconds, %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Olùka ka ìtẹ̀léra %d nínú %d láàárín ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %.1f, ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %d sẹ́yìn."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
msgid "No inventory has been read on this poller."
msgstr "A kò tíì ka àkójọpọ̀ kankan lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò yìí."

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The last inventory failed %d seconds ago and the previous one is still in use: %s"
msgstr "Àkójọpọ̀ tí ó kẹ́yìn kùnà ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %d sẹ́yìn, èyí tí ó ṣáájú sì ṣì wà ní lílò: %s"

#: lib/HealthCheck.php
#, php-format
msgid "The inventory listed %d targets %d seconds ago."
msgstr "Àkójọpọ̀ ṣe àtòjọ àwọn àfojúsùn %d ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %d sẹ́yìn."

