msgstr "Kó Ìṣètò SmokePing Wọlé"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Ìṣètò"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The configured SmokePing file is read with the files it includes, from its own directory. An uploaded file is read on its own: @include is not allowed in it."
msgstr "A ń ka fáìlì SmokePing tí a ṣètò pẹ̀lú àwọn fáìlì tí ó ní nínú, láti inú àpò tirẹ̀. A ń ka fáìlì tí a gbé sókè fúnra rẹ̀: a kò gba @include láàyè nínú rẹ̀."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
#, php-format
msgid "The configured file, %s"
msgstr "Fáìlì tí a ṣètò, %s"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "An uploaded file, without @include"
msgstr "Fáìlì tí a gbé sókè, láìsí @include"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Uploaded File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Tí A Gbé Sókè"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for an uploaded file: a SmokePing configuration of at most 4 MiB."
msgstr "Fún fáìlì tí a gbé sókè nìkan: ìṣètò SmokePing tí kò ju 4 MiB lọ."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Àwọn ẹ̀rọ"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host groups targets that probe the same host. A device that already has the host name on the chosen poller is used instead of a new one."
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ kan fún olùgbàlejò SmokePing kọ̀ọ̀kan ń kó àwọn àfojúsùn tí ó ń ṣàyẹ̀wò olùgbàlejò kan náà jọ. A ó lo ẹ̀rọ tí ó ti ní orúkọ olùgbàlejò náà lórí olùṣàyẹ̀wò tí a yàn dípò tuntun."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing host"
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ kan fún olùgbàlejò SmokePing kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "One device per SmokePing target"
msgstr "Ẹ̀rọ kan fún àfojúsùn SmokePing kọ̀ọ̀kan"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Device Template"
msgstr "Àdàkọ Ẹ̀rọ"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The template of devices the import creates."
msgstr "Àdàkọ ti àwọn ẹ̀rọ tí ìkówọlé náà dá sílẹ̀."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The poller of new devices. It must be the poller that runs the SmokePing reader, or their summary data sources get no data."
msgstr "Olùṣàyẹ̀wò ti àwọn ẹ̀rọ tuntun. Ó gbọ́dọ̀ jẹ́ olùṣàyẹ̀wò tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ olùka SmokePing, tàbí àwọn orísun dátà àkópọ̀ wọn kò ní gba dátà kankan."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Ibùdó"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "The site of new devices."
msgstr "Ibùdó ti àwọn ẹ̀rọ tuntun."

#: lib/ImportPage.php smokeping_inventory.php
msgid "None"
msgstr "Kò sí"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Graph Tree"
msgstr "Igi Àwòrán"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Mirror the SmokePing hierarchy into a graph tree: each section becomes a branch, and each device a host under the branch of its targets. Existing branches and hosts are reused."
msgstr "Ṣe àfarawé ètò ìṣàkóso SmokePing sínú igi àwòrán: abala kọ̀ọ̀kan yóò di ẹ̀ka kan, ẹ̀rọ kọ̀ọ̀kan yóò sì di olùgbàlejò lábẹ́ ẹ̀ka ti àwọn àfojúsùn rẹ̀. A ó tún àwọn ẹ̀ka àti olùgbàlejò tí ó ti wà tẹ́lẹ̀ lò."

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "A new tree, named below"
msgstr "Igi tuntun kan, tí a dárúkọ rẹ̀ nísàlẹ̀"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Do not mirror"
msgstr "Má ṣe àfarawé"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "New Tree Name"
msgstr "Orúkọ Igi Tuntun"

#: lib/ImportPage.php
msgid "Only for a new tree. A tree that already has this name is used."
msgstr "Fún igi tuntun nìkan. A ó lo igi tí ó ti ní orúkọ yìí tẹ́lẹ̀."

