#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Source"
msgstr "Orísun SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Poller"
msgstr "Olùṣàyẹ̀wò SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The Cacti poller that runs on, or shares a filesystem with, the SmokePing host. Only this poller reads SmokePing data."
msgstr "Olùṣàyẹ̀wò Cacti tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ lórí, tàbí tí ó ń lo ètò fáìlì kan náà pẹ̀lú, olùgbàlejò SmokePing. Olùṣàyẹ̀wò yìí nìkan ni ó ń ka dátà SmokePing."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Configuration File"
msgstr "Fáìlì Ìṣètò SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The main SmokePing configuration file, read by the poller that runs the reader. The plugin reads it and the files it includes with its own parser and never writes to them. Includes must stay inside this file's directory."
msgstr "Fáìlì ìṣètò SmokePing pàtàkì, tí olùṣàyẹ̀wò tí ó ń ṣiṣẹ́ olùkàwé ń kà. Àfikún náà ń ka òun àti àwọn fáìlì tí ó ní nínú pẹ̀lú olùtúmọ̀ tirẹ̀, kò sì kọ ohunkóhun sí inú wọn láé. Àwọn fáìlì tí ó wà nínú rẹ̀ gbọ́dọ̀ wà ní àpò fáìlì ti fáìlì yìí."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "SmokePing Data Directory"
msgstr "Àpò Dátà SmokePing"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "The datadir from SmokePing's configuration, as SmokePing sees it."
msgstr "datadir láti inú ìṣètò SmokePing, gẹ́gẹ́ bí SmokePing ṣe rí i."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Cacti Mount of the Data Directory"
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ Cacti sí Àpò Dátà"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "A read-only bind or NFS mount of the SmokePing data directory inside the Cacti RRA path. Cacti only reads RRD files inside its RRA path and never through a symlink."
msgstr "Ìsopọ̀ bind tàbí NFS ti kíka-nìkan ti àpò dátà SmokePing nínú ọ̀nà RRA Cacti. Cacti ń ka àwọn fáìlì RRD nínú ọ̀nà RRA rẹ̀ nìkan, kì í sì í kà wọ́n nípasẹ̀ ìsopọ̀-àfọwọ́ṣe (symlink) láé."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader"
msgstr "Olùka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Reader Time Budget"
msgstr "Ìṣúná Àkókò Olùka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one reader run may spend reading RRD files before it stops and resumes on the next poller cycle."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ìṣiṣẹ́ olùkàwé kan lè lò láti ka àwọn fáìlì RRD kí ó tó dáwọ́ dúró kí ó sì tẹ̀síwájú ní ìyípo olùṣàyẹ̀wò tí ó tẹ̀lé."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Inventory Interval"
msgstr "Àlàfo Ìṣàkójọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Minimum seconds between inventory runs. The inventory also runs when the configuration file changes."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tó kéré jùlọ láàárín àwọn ìṣiṣẹ́ ìṣàkójọ. Ìṣàkójọ náà tún ń ṣiṣẹ́ nígbà tí fáìlì ìṣètò bá yípadà."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness Allowance"
msgstr "Ààyè Ìtuntun"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds past one step for which a measurement still counts as current."
msgstr "Ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá tí ó kọjá ìgbésẹ̀ kan tí ìwọ̀n sì ṣì wà ní kíkà gẹ́gẹ́ bí èyí tí ó ṣẹ̀ṣẹ̀ dé."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Loss Colors"
msgstr "Àwọn Àwọ̀ Àdánù"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Which SmokePing loss colors the smoke graphs draw. SmokePing 2.7 draws other loss levels than 2.8 and later. Automatic follows the SmokePing version the reader finds next to SmokePing, shown on the health page, and uses 2.8 and later when it finds none."
msgstr "Àwọn àwọ̀ àdánù SmokePing tí àwọn àwòrán èéfín ń yà. SmokePing 2.7 ń ya àwọn ìpele àdánù mìíràn ju 2.8 àti àwọn tí ó tẹ̀lé e lọ. Àdáṣe ń tẹ̀lé ẹ̀yà SmokePing tí olùkàwé rí lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ SmokePing, tí a fi hàn lórí ojú-ewé ìlera, ó sì ń lo 2.8 àti àwọn tí ó tẹ̀lé e nígbà tí kò bá rí èyíkéyìí."

